## ArticleMetabolic Changes during In Vivo Maturation of PSC-Derived Skeletal Myogenic Progenitors
Citation: Abreu, P.; Garay, B.I.; Nemkov, T.; Yamashita, A.M.S.; Perlingeiro, R.C.R. Metabolic Changes during In Vivo Maturation of PSC-Derived Skeletal Myogenic Progenitors. Cells 2024, 13, 76. https://doi.org/10.3390/cells13010076
